{"date":"2026-11-16","sentence":{"cantonese":"早晨！好耐冇見，你好嗎？","jyutping":"zou2 san4! hou2 noi6 mou5 gin3, nei5 hou2 maa3?","mandarin":"早上好！好久不见，你好吗？"},"theme":"问候与礼貌","tip":"客家话说「你好嗎」容易把尾字「嗎」读成轻声或上扬；粤语裡「嗎 maa3」是第 3 声中平调，尾音要拉平、拉长，aa 是长元音，读成 maa——不要读成短促的 ma。","weekday":"周一","words":[{"cantonese":"你好嗎","hakka":"ngi2 ho3 ma","jyutping":"nei5 hou2 maa3","mandarin":"你好吗？"},{"cantonese":"失陪","hakka":"sit2 pui2","jyutping":"sat1 pui4","mandarin":"失陪一下（暂时离开）"},{"cantonese":"打招呼","hakka":"da3 zeu1 fu1","jyutping":"daa2 ziu1 fu1","mandarin":"打招呼"},{"cantonese":"問候","hakka":"mun4 heu4","jyutping":"man6 hau6","mandarin":"问候"},{"cantonese":"歡迎光臨","hakka":"fan1 yin2 gong1 lim2","jyutping":"fun1 jing4 gwong1 lam4","mandarin":"欢迎光临"}]}